{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1789803478586,"sessionID":"ses_f47666065ffeuS2A9UdfP1HUlV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_890fb913fbbb41d988fae2f1","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/tmp/opencode/dogfood/D2-ON-1/work/NOTES.md"},"output":"<path>/tmp/opencode/dogfood/D2-ON-1/work/NOTES.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Cache eviction (2026-02)\n2: \n3: When the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\n4: entry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\n5: bookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n6: \n7: Kept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\n8: few extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.\n\n(End of file - total 8 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Cache eviction (2026-02)\n\nWhen the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\nentry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\nbookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n\nKept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\nfew extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/tmp/opencode/dogfood/D2-ON-1/work/NOTES.md","text":"# Cache eviction (2026-02)\n\nWhen the cache is full, `put` clears the entire map, then inserts the new\nentry. Simple and amortized fine: one bulk free instead of fiddly per-entry\nbookkeeping. `evictions()` counts the entries dropped by these clears.\n\nKept as-is: callers re-fetch on miss, so a cold cache after a clear is just a\nfew extra reads. Do not over-engineer this.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":8,"totalLines":8,"truncated":false}},"title":"tmp/opencode/dogfood/D2-ON-1/work/NOTES.md","time":{"start":1789803478563,"end":1789803478570}},"id":"prt_0b899bdd0001Fhq7MKnWm3Qwsd","sessionID":"ses_f47666065ffeuS2A9UdfP1HUlV","messageID":"msg_0b899a10b001g3t9BoXhfeLV